1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,800
Welcome to SynapseDesk AI, an autonomous spatial cognition workspace built natively for Meta Quest.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Traditional VR productivity apps overwhelm users with 2D walls that force standing roomscale reaching and physical neck strain.

3
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:24,200
SynapseDesk AI re-architects spatial computing around human ergonomics and seated flow state.

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:33,000
Designed for the Airplane Seat Test, every panel, dial, and prism operates inside an ergonomic two-foot radius arc (r=0.55m).

5
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:41,500
Deployed live on Vercel at synapsedesk-ai.vercel.app, judges and users enter XR with zero installation friction.

6
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:48,800
The experience is 100% hands-first: not a single controller is required to complete the entire workflow.

7
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:56,800
Using Meta's official PokeInteractable finger physics, we reach out with our index fingertip to press cockpit controls.

8
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,800
Notice how the three curved panels hug our natural forty-degree field-of-view corridor at seated lap height.

9
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,500
On the Cognitive Capture panel, switch effortlessly between Horizon Store Launch, Quantum Studies, and 60 FPS VR Latency presets.

10
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:18,500
At the center of our workspace floats the Synapse Core: an interactive holographic AI agent entity.

11
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:27,200
When given a complex goal, the agent acts spatially, decomposing our ambition into prioritized 3D physical task prisms.

12
00:01:27,500 --> 00:01:36,000
Users reach out with bare hands, using natural pinch gestures (OneHandGrabbable) to lift and inspect nodes in 3D space.

13
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:45,500
Touching the crystalline core triggers real-time force-directed relaxation, magnetically auto-clustering floating nodes into an ergonomic arc.

14
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:54,500
To satisfy the One Bus Stop Test, SynapseDesk AI integrates a five-minute seated focus sprint.

15
00:01:54,800 --> 00:02:02,500
Tapping Start initiates countdown, accompanied by zero-latency procedural Web Audio chimes synthesized directly in the browser.

16
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:09,800
As we complete milestones, our active cognitive load automatically recalculates: shifting down to a balanced flow state (34%).

17
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:14,800
With a single tap, the agent compiles and exports a complete structured action plan to our workflow.

18
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:22,800
By deploying directly on Vercel at synapsedesk-ai.vercel.app, SynapseDesk AI eliminates Horizon store APK approval delays.

19
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:30,500
The entire engine combines Three.js r185, Havok WebAssembly physics, and Meta Horizon design systems locked at 60 FPS.

20
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:42,500
Built for the Meta VR Start Developer Competition 2026, SynapseDesk AI demonstrates the future of hands-first, seated spatial productivity.
